WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Jiaojiao, you are just too kind and too sensible, and you will suffer in the future.

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,500
Jiaojiao, uncle apologizes to you for Sichun

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,700
Can I ask my assistant to buy you a new dress and new toys later?

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,210
Thank you uncle

5
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:20,510
I sent someone to give a big gift to the Lu family and wish Mr. Lu a happy birthday. If no one can come, there must be no lack of reason.

6
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:24,340
Yes, wait, remember to prepare a gift for Yoyo too

7
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:27,640
Forget it, I will choose Yoyo’s gift personally.

8
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,140
Dad, let me choose

9
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:35,060
Okay, son, Brother Pei, Xiao Su, you also come to participate in the Lu family’s trial

10
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:42,330
The Huo family in the capital where you were born is actually here too

11
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:44,220
Brother Huo

12
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:47,720
Uncle Huo, come with me, I'll take you to a feast

13
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:49,770
Thank you Uncle Huo

14
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:55,330
It’s not easy to go to Taoyuan Village. Once you come, you can get to know the richest man, the Lu family.

15
00:00:55,330 --> 00:01:00,360
Secondly, he wanted to see whose security guard Old Man Lu was.

16
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:04,660
There are children in the village. Please stop here.

17
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:06,660
So as not to injure the children if there are too many people in the car

18
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:12,340
What kind of kid is so obsessed with money that he can't even drive in the car?
